# Blog Scope

When the user is working on the blog module, Sanity integration, or admin blog editor:

- Delegate to the **fal-blog-developer** subagent
- Invoke with: `/fal-blog-developer` or "Use the fal-blog-developer to..."

The blog developer works in:

- `src/modules/blog/`
- `src/components/admin/` (blog editor UI)
- `src/pages/admin/`, `src/pages/blogs/`
- `src/pages/api/admin/blog/`, `src/pages/api/blog/`

Handles: mock/Sanity blog providers, Portable Text, Lexical editor, revalidation, and Arabic-only blog routes.
